return ['x-generator'=>'GlotPress/4.0.3','translation-revision-date'=>'2021-02-04 13:00:38+0000','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=n != 1;','project-id-version'=>'Themes - Twenty Twenty','language'=>'eu_ES','messages'=>['Our default theme for 2020 is designed to take full advantage of the flexibility of the block editor. Organizations and businesses have the ability to create dynamic landing pages with endless layouts using the group and column blocks. The centered content column and fine-tuned typography also makes it perfect for traditional blogs. Complete editor styles give you a good idea of what your content will look like, even before you publish. You can give your site a personal touch by changing the background colors and the accent color in the Customizer. The colors of all elements on your site are automatically calculated based on the colors you pick, ensuring a high, accessible color contrast for your visitors.'=>'2020. urterako lehenetsitako itxura, izan ere, bloke-editorearen malgutasunez abantaila osoa hartzeko diseinaturik dago. Talde- eta zutabe-blokeak erabiliz, erakundeek eta negozioek hamaika diseinudun helburu-orrialde dinamikoak sortzea daukate. Eduki zentratudun zutabeari eta finki-egokitutako tipografiari esker, perfektua da ohizko blogetarako. Editore-estilo osoek zure edukiaren itxuraren ikuspegi doia ematen dizute, baita argitaratu aurretik ere. Pertsonalizatzailean atzekaldeko koloreak eta nabarmentze-kolorea aldatuz, ukitu pertsonal bat eman diezaiokezu zure guneari. Zure gunearen elementu guztien koloreak automatikoki kalkulatzen dira, zuk aukeratutako koloreetan oinarrituz eta zure bisitarientzako kolore-kontraste eta erabilgarritasun handia ziurtatuz.      ','Twenty Twenty'=>'Twenty Twenty','colorCustom'=>'Pertsonalizatu','colorDefault'=>'Lehenetsia','With seven floors of striking architecture, UMoMA shows exhibitions of international contemporary art, sometimes along with art historical retrospectives. Existential, political, and